      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "FENDI's 2027 Resort collection welcomes a new addition to the Baguette family: the**Baguette Urban**, a clever fusion of the men's crossbody bag and the compact, elongated Baguette silhouette. Its most distinctive feature is the FF buckle, which uses a webbing insert-lock structure that echoes the wide fabric shoulder strap, giving it an everyday, versatile feel.",
