    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The standout feature of the Baguette Urban is undoubtedly the central FF buckle: a silver metal FF insert-lock structure with a fabric trim beneath it. Visually, it resembles the operation of a belt buckle, but in fact you simply press both sides of the FF to open the lock, revealing a minimalist modern style. This bag is crafted from grey-green Roman leather with a natural grain texture, made using a metal-free tanning process.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
